cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software if you use its implementation. Add the published manuscript citation when a verified record is available."
type: software
title: "Swim4Track: Trajectory-Conditioned Reinforcement Learning for Direct Thruster Control of Underwater Vehicles"
authors:
  - family-names: Akram
    given-names: Waseem
  - family-names: Ferreira
    given-names: Fausto
abstract: >-
  Research implementation of trajectory-conditioned direct-thruster control
  with a Python underwater-vehicle plant, a frozen TQC checkpoint, and a
  ROS 2 interface for Stonefish simulation. Includes a classical PID
  comparator and reproducible demonstration workflows.
keywords:
  - underwater robotics
  - trajectory tracking
  - reinforcement learning
  - direct thruster control
  - Stonefish
